#*: I turn, as I must, to [[wikipedia:Donald Trump|Mr Trump]]. His comments about Muslims are wrong. His policy to close borders, if he is elected as President, is bonkers. If he met one or two of my constituents in one of the many excellent pubs in my constituency, they may well tell him that he is a '''wazzock''' for dealing with the issue in that way.

